  <name>Toot</name>
  <summary>Your corner of the fediverse</summary>
  <description>
    <p>Toot is a Mastodon client made for the COSMIC desktop. Follow conversations, discover new voices, and share your thoughts from an app that feels at home on your desktop.</p>
    <p>Read timelines, explore profiles, reply to posts, and keep favorites and bookmarks. Connect multiple accounts, add images with descriptions, and watch videos.</p>
    <p>Toot is under active development.</p>
  </description>
